<title>USA: Merry Land completes Waterford Place buy.</title>
<headline>Merry Land completes Waterford Place buy.</headline>
<dateline>AUGUSTA, Ga. 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merry Land &amp; Investment Co Inc said on Wednesday it completed the purchase of Waterford Place for $11.1 million in an all cash transaction.</p>
<p>Waterford is a 180 unit luxury apartment community located in Nashville, Tenn.</p>
<p>Merry Land, up 1/8 at 20-1/4 in early morning trading, is a Real Estate Investment Trust (REIT) which operates and owns apartments.</p>
</text>
